{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"MoovKit"}],"title":"Tap to Share","roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tap to Share"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" extends Tap to Pay on iPhone so a merchant can connect to a customer’s iPhone and exchange information. Your app can show the customer their full cart, ask them for an email address or shipping address, sign them up for a membership, and let them pay with Apple Pay on their own device."}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Important","type":"text"}]},{"text":": Tap to Share requires ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 27 or later"}]},{"text":" on ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iPhone 12 or later"}]},{"text":". It is a stricter device requirement than Tap to Pay on iPhone.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","type":"aside"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every Tap to Share API is annotated ","type":"text"},{"code":"@available(iOS 27.0, *)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so an app with a lower deployment target keeps building unchanged. The one exception is ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/isCustomerSessionSupported()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", which is callable on every version MoovKit supports and returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" below iOS 27 — use it to branch without an ","type":"text"},{"code":"#available","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" check of your own.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["guard moov.isCustomerSessionSupported() else {","    \/\/ Fall back to a card tap on the merchant's iPhone.","    return","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Project-Setup","text":"Project Setup","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build MoovKit from source with Xcode 27 or later. Runtime availability checks let the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"keep a lower deployment target, but the compiler still needs the iOS 27 SDK.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tap to Share builds on the Tap to Pay on iPhone entitlement described in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Getting-Started","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". In addition, add the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tap to Share"}]},{"text":" capability to your app target in Xcode under ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Signing & Capabilities","type":"text"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requesting Apple Pay on the customer’s device also requires the Apple Pay capability, and processing that payment through Moov requires the delegated-payments entitlement described in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Tap-to-Share#Requesting-an-Apple-Pay-payment","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Opening a session","anchor":"Opening-a-session"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/initReader(reader:)"},{"type":"text","text":" first. Register an event handler before opening the session so you observe the connection from the start, then open it and wait for the customer’s device to become ready."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["await moov.setCustomerEventHandler { event in","    switch event {","    case .connected:    \/\/ The customer's device connected.","    case .ready:        \/\/ Safe to share a cart or request information.","    case .disconnected: \/\/ The customer's device went away.","    case .closed:       \/\/ The session ended.","    case .unsupported:  \/\/ An event added after this SDK release.","    }","}","","let configuration = CustomerSessionConfiguration(","    currency: .USD,","    region: .unitedStates,","    privacyPolicyURL: URL(string: \"https:\/\/example.com\/privacy\")!,","    storeName: \"Oakbrook Mall\",","    deviceName: \"Emily\"",")","","try await moov.createCustomerSession(configuration: configuration)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createCustomerSession(configuration:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returns once the two devices have been brought together. Wait for "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionEvent\/ready"},{"type":"text","text":" before sending requests; sending one earlier throws "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/notReady"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"MoovKit authenticates the session for you. If a Tap to Pay session already exists because you called ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/createSession(invalidateTerminalConfiguration:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", it reuses that session. Otherwise it fetches a card reader token from your ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/TerminalConfigurationProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". An expired credential is retried once against a fresh configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Close the session as soon as the workflow finishes so the customer’s device is not left connected:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["await moov.closeCustomerSession()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Sharing-a-shopping-cart","text":"Sharing a shopping cart"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cart on the customer’s device is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"stateless"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Every call to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/updateShoppingCart(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" replaces it in full, so always send the complete cart rather than a delta. Sharing an empty cart is a valid way to put a placeholder on their screen for the rest of the session."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Amounts are in the main currency unit — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"15.00"},{"text":" for $15.00 — and are formatted using the currency and region from your ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionConfiguration"},{"text":" together with the customer’s own locale.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each item requires a unique "},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Reuse that identifier for the same product across cart updates so the customer’s device can animate quantity and price changes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let cart = ShoppingCart(","    items: [","        ShoppingCart.Item(","            \/\/ A stable identifier keeps cart animations smooth across updates.","            id: \"HRSP-M-UN-11-001\",","            name: \"Hair Spray\",","            quantity: 4,","            totalPrice: Decimal(string: \"20.00\")!,","            totalAdjustedPrice: Decimal(string: \"15.00\")!,","            descriptions: [\"Unscented, 11 oz\", \"Buy 3 Get 1 Free Offer\"],","            details: [\"This item cannot be shipped.\"]","        ),","    ],","    summary: ShoppingCart.Summary(","        summaryLines: [","            ShoppingCart.Summary.LineItem(label: \"Subtotal\", value: Decimal(string: \"15.00\")!),","            ShoppingCart.Summary.LineItem(label: \"Coupon Code: NY2OFF\", value: Decimal(string: \"-2.00\")!),","            \/\/ Values that are not amounts are displayed verbatim.","            ShoppingCart.Summary.LineItem(label: \"Shipping\", value: \"Free\"),","            ShoppingCart.Summary.LineItem(label: \"Tax\", value: \"10%\"),","        ],","        footer: \"Thank you for shopping with us.\",","        total: Decimal(string: \"14.30\")!","    )",")","","let cartToken = try await moov.updateShoppingCart(cart)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Keep the returned ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/ShoppingCartToken","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Apple requires it to offer Apple Pay against that cart.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can also set a predefined screen when no request form is showing:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["try await moov.updateCustomerStatus(.paymentCompleted)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Requesting information","anchor":"Requesting-information","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each request presents a form on the customer’s device. The customer chooses what to share, so fields you asked for may still come back "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", and declining the request entirely throws "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/userDeclined"},{"type":"text","text":". Only one form can be on screen at a time; overlapping requests throw "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/sessionBusy"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Look up an existing account.","let info = try await moov.requestCustomerInfo(","    purpose: .checkIn,","    fields: [.emailAddress],","    message: \"Look up your account\"",")","","\/\/ Collect a shipping address, plus contact details.","let address = try await moov.requestAddress(","    purpose: .shipping,","    fields: [.emailAddress, .phoneNumber]",")","","\/\/ Sign the customer up, offering marketing opt-ins.","let signUp = try await moov.requestSignup(","    fields: [.emailAddress, .phoneNumber],","    emailConsent: .visible,","    smsConsent: .visible,","    termsAndConditions: \"**Terms and Conditions**\\n\\nYour terms, in Markdown.\"",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Apple also supports requesting a customer’s Wallet pass for account lookup, and adding a pass to their Wallet. MoovKit deliberately exposes neither, so ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerField","type":"reference"},{"text":" offers only email address and phone number.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"level":2,"text":"Requesting an Apple Pay payment","anchor":"Requesting-an-Apple-Pay-payment","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apple only displays the Apple Pay option against a cart that was already shared, so pass the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/ShoppingCartToken","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" from your most recent "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/updateShoppingCart(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" call. Check "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/customerClientType","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" first: only a customer on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerClientType\/localWireless","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is on a compatible iOS version."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["guard await moov.customerClientType == .localWireless else {","    \/\/ Fall back to a card tap on the merchant's iPhone.","    return","}","","let paymentRequest = PKPaymentRequest()","paymentRequest.merchantIdentifier = \"merchant.com.example.posapp\"","paymentRequest.currencyCode = \"USD\"","paymentRequest.countryCode = \"US\"","paymentRequest.supportedNetworks = [.amex, .discover, .masterCard, .visa]","paymentRequest.merchantCapabilities = .threeDSecure","paymentRequest.paymentSummaryItems = paymentSummaryItems","","\/\/ Required for Moov to be able to decrypt the resulting payment token.","paymentRequest.isDelegatedRequest = true","","let presented = try await moov.requestApplePayPayment(","    for: cartToken,","    using: paymentRequest,","    delegate: paymentAuthorizationControllerDelegate",")","","if !presented {","    \/\/ The customer picked a non-Apple Pay option, or has not set up Apple Pay.","    \/\/ Fall back to another payment method.","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"MoovKit presents the sheet and forwards authorization to your delegate; it does not process the resulting ","type":"text"},{"code":"PKPayment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Send that payment to your backend and link it with Moov’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/accounts\/{accountID}\/apple-pay\/tokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" endpoint, which accepts the same ","type":"text"},{"code":"paymentData","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" blob as Apple Pay on the web.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Important"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A payment token is encrypted to the payment processing certificate of the merchant identifier in the request. For Moov to decrypt it, set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isDelegatedRequest"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" so your app presents on behalf of the Moov merchant. That requires the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.in-app-payments-delegate"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement and your app to be registered as an Apple Pay delegate. Without it, Apple encrypts the token to a certificate Moov does not hold."}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Moov does not offer Apple Pay in test mode. In test mode "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/requestApplePayPayment(for:using:delegate:)"},{"type":"text","text":" always returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" so your integration takes its normal fallback path."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Test-Mode","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Test Mode"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tap to Share follows the mode of your terminal configuration. In test mode the session presents no customer UI: it records what you shared and returns canned customer responses, so you can exercise the whole flow in a simulator with no second device. Requests before the session is open throw ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/notReady","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", matching the real session. See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Test-Mode","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"What-you-can-and-cannot-test-in-the-simulator","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"What you can and cannot test in the simulator"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Simulator","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Device","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Test mode session","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cart, status and request plumbing"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Real customer connection"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Requires a second iPhone","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apple Pay on the customer’s device"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Production only"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"test mode","type":"text"}]},{"text":" session runs anywhere, so the simulator is the right place to build and verify your cart layout, request sequencing and error handling.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"production"}]},{"type":"text","text":" session cannot be opened in the simulator. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/createCustomerSession(configuration:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/notSupported","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" there, and end-to-end testing needs two physical devices: a merchant iPhone 12 or later carrying the entitlement and capability, plus a customer iPhone, both on iOS 27 with Wi-Fi enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/isCustomerSessionSupported()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the simulator, because the underlying reader reports itself as supported there. Use it to decide whether to show Tap to Share in your UI, not as a guarantee that a production session will open — always handle "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/notSupported","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Handling-errors","text":"Handling errors"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Session failures surface as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Cases worth handling explicitly:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/notSupported"},{"type":"text","text":" — the device or OS cannot run Tap to Share."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/wifiDisabled","type":"reference"},{"text":" — Tap to Share needs Wi-Fi on, even when the merchant’s iPhone is on cellular.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/notReady","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — a request was sent before the customer’s device was ready."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/sessionBusy","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — a form is already on the customer’s screen."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionError\/userDeclined","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — the customer declined to share.","type":"text"}]}]}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Tap-to-Share"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/moovkit\/tap-to-share"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/moovkit\/tap-to-share"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Share a shopping cart and collect customer details on the customer’s own iPhone.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit"]]},"references":{"doc://io.moov.MoovKit/documentation/MoovKit/Moov/createCustomerSession(configuration:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/moovkit\/moov\/createcustomersession(configuration:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Opens a Tap to Share session and waits for the customer’s device to connect."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"createCustomerSession","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CustomerSessionConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7MoovKit28CustomerSessionConfigurationV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"createCustomerSession(configuration:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/createCustomerSession(configuration:)"},"doc://io.moov.MoovKit/documentation/MoovKit/CustomerSessionEvent/ready":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/CustomerSessionEvent\/ready","url":"\/documentation\/moovkit\/customersessionevent\/ready","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The customer’s device is ready to accept requests."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ready","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"CustomerSessionEvent.ready"},"doc://io.moov.MoovKit/documentation/MoovKit/Moov/customerClientType":{"url":"\/documentation\/moovkit\/moov\/customerclienttype","abstract":[{"text":"The kind of customer device connected to the active Tap to Share session.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerClientType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7MoovKit18CustomerClientTypeO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CustomerClientType"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"customerClientType","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/customerClientType"},"doc://io.moov.MoovKit/documentation/MoovKit/Getting-Started":{"role":"article","type":"topic","title":"Getting Started","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Getting-Started","url":"\/documentation\/moovkit\/getting-started","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide walks you through the steps to integrate "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"MoovKit","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" into your iOS application to support "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tap to Pay on iPhone"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://io.moov.MoovKit/documentation/MoovKit/Moov/requestApplePayPayment(for:using:delegate:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/moovkit\/moov\/requestapplepaypayment(for:using:delegate:)","abstract":[{"text":"Asks the customer to pay for a shared cart with Apple Pay on their own iPhone.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestApplePayPayment","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ShoppingCartToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7MoovKit17ShoppingCartTokenV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"using","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PKPaymentRequest","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)PKPaymentRequest"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"delegate"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"any","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(pl)PKPaymentAuthorizationControllerDelegate","text":"PKPaymentAuthorizationControllerDelegate"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"requestApplePayPayment(for:using:delegate:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/io.moov.MoovKit\/documentation\/MoovKit\/Moov\/requestApplePayPayment(for:using:delegate:)"},"doc://io.moov.MoovKit/documentation/MoovKit/Test-Mode":{"abstract":[{"text":"Learn how to use test mode to test your Tap to Pay integration without physical payment cards.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/moovkit\/test-mode","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic","t